Alembic migrations for the sec-rag Postgres schema.

Source of truth: src/secrag/storage/models.py. The DB URL comes from .env (see migrations/env.py).

Workflow:
  1. Change the models.
  2. uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "short description"
  3. Review the generated file in migrations/versions/ (autogenerate misses renames and
     can duplicate enum CHECK constraints).
  4. uv run alembic upgrade head
Roll back one step with: uv run alembic downgrade -1
